{"page": 4, "kind": "cell", "table": 1, "row": 18, "col": 4, "x": null, "text": "• Impacts of Sandalwood: increase in maritime merchant traffic, shift from subsistence agriculture to market economy, unsustainable harvesting practices • Impacts of Whaling: growth of businesses to supply ships (e.g., bakeries, blacksmiths, carpenters, laundries, sail makers), growth of whaling towns, selling of non-native foods to sailors", "id": "u92", "furniture": false}
